#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:3
#: ea21d36918a54ef19a1852264b250c0b
msgid "自旋螺旋（Spin Spiral）"
msgstr "Spin Spiral"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:5
#: 1b2a7d402a6e4fbbaba236eb47664297
msgid "`Group`: `Magnetism` | `Class`: `SpinSpiralCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:7
#: 55c8c4763ba545ca866036a63bb5c873
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:9
#: cf2260bf8c3a471290edcbd6ee166834
msgid ""
"对输入结构按一维相位场写入非共线 `initial_magmoms`，生成一批不同周期、相位、手性和轴向分量的 spin spiral / "
"helix / conical spiral 初始构型。支持两种等价的主控方式：直接扫周期 L_D 或扫每 Angstrom 转角梯度。"
msgstr ""
"Write noncollinear `initial_magmoms` from a one-dimensional phase field, "
"generating spin-spiral, planar-helix, and conical-spiral initial states "
"over periods, phases, chiralities, and axial components. Control the "
"spiral either by scanning its period `L_D` or by scanning the rotation "
"gradient in degrees per Å."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:11
#: 2ef08fab24b444e3b5617dc3017a1a0e
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{m}(u)=\\sqrt{1-m_z^2}\\left[\\cos\\phi(u)\\,\\mathbf{e}_1+\\sin\\phi(u)\\,\\mathbf{e}_2\\right]"
" + m_z\\,\\hat{\\mathbf{n}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:13
#: f6ccb76522d24424bdb35454e1382d43
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\phi(u)=s\\cdot \\frac{2\\pi u}{L_D}+\\phi_0,\\qquad s\\in\\{-1,+1\\}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:15
#: ce5dc0548a634149921d37671f5b3a36
msgid "其中 m_z = m_parallel / |m| 是无量纲轴向分量。m_z=0 为平面 helix，m_z=0 为 conical spiral。"
msgstr ""
"Here `m_z = m_parallel / |m|` is the dimensionless component along the "
"propagation axis. `m_z = 0` gives a planar helix; nonzero `m_z` gives a "
"conical spiral."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:17
#: 9c4d003f096e43b2b01f00b57ba8f2a7
msgid "**关键限制：** 这张卡只写入初始磁矩纹理，不改变晶体结构。如果当前晶格与目标周期不相容，需要先扩胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Important limitation:** This card changes only the initial moment "
"texture. If the target period is incompatible with the current periodic "
"cell, enlarge the structure first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:19
#: 36c2c8c1f1c2418fbd3a833d0a769ca7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:21
#: a645a874c93f407ab822bd72f5f0b2c8
msgid "场景：模型在螺旋磁结构上能量曲线完全不对"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: the predicted energy curve is wrong for spiral magnetic "
"structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:23
#: dc27e2b937fd43d8a3b59dbde3be0bb5
msgid ""
"你训练了一个 NEP 模型，训练集里有 FM 和 AFM 构型。模型在共线磁序上表现尚可，但一跑到具有螺旋磁序的构型（如 CrNb3S6 或 "
"MnSi 中的 chiral helimagnet），能量曲线形状完全错误——周期依赖的能量极小值位置偏离 DFT 结果超过 30%。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model with FM and AFM configurations. It performs "
"acceptably for collinear orders, but for spiral states such as chiral "
"helices in CrNb3S6 or MnSi, the shape of the energy curve is wrong and "
"the period-dependent minimum differs from DFT by more than 30%."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:25
#: 8815069e95a24c93adaadfae2f2732fb
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 模型从未见过磁矩在空间中连续旋转的构型。FM/AFM "
"训练集隐式告诉了模型\"磁矩方向在空间中是分段常数\"的假设。需要在训练集里加入不同周期的螺旋磁纹理，让模型学习 q 空间不同波矢下的能量响应。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The model has never seen moments rotate continuously "
"through space. FM and AFM examples cover only a few discrete directional "
"patterns. Add spiral textures over several wave vectors so the model can "
"learn the energy response `E(q)` across the relevant region of reciprocal"
" space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:27
#: 366238f15d7a4e008cb0fe26e95c7b86
msgid "**输入：** 一个已知磁矩幅值的磁性结构（如 MnSi 单胞，Mn 磁矩约 2.0 μB，螺旋沿 [111] 方向）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A magnetic structure with known moment magnitudes, such as an "
"MnSi cell with approximately 2.0 μB on Mn and propagation along [111]."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:29
#: efe9f241e26746f28cec5f4c898bd3de
msgid ""
"**目标：** 沿 [111] 方向扫描 3 个周期（20/30/40 Angstrom），3 个全局相位（0/30/60 度），纯 "
"helix（mz=0），正反手性成对。共 3x3x2 = 18 个螺旋构型"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Along [111], scan three periods (20, 30, and 40 Å), three "
"global phases (0°, 30°, and 60°), a planar helix (`mz=0`), and both "
"chiralities: 3 × 3 × 2 = 18 structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:31
#: 7ec9dc850df348e19cd11a9dafb3e688
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:32
#: 2739e2412ec74552954abe7b2529eae7
msgid "`Propagation Axis` = `[1, 1, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:33
#: 682445456f6942ccb9855c4789c82ff1
msgid "`Spiral Parameter` = `Period (L_D)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:34
#: 268d7a9f3f704fdab331ca77b4b880d3
msgid "`Period Range` = `[20, 40, 10]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:35
#: e34be45f04b34d87882fdf6ab4df4d31
msgid "`Phase Range` = `[0, 60, 30]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:36
#: 7c0e9bd9a2404f72848b9ca810ad25ab
msgid "`m_parallel Range` = `[0, 0, 0.1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:37
#: fd8feaf4c00c4b84b2e3791f06834908
msgid "`Chirality` = `Both`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:39
#: 420699141b0a4fbeb27f48303aedd8a4
msgid ""
"**输出：** 18 个结构，磁矩沿 [111] 方向逐层旋转，带 "
"`Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 18 structures whose moments rotate along [111], labeled "
"`Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:41
#: 0ac0356c220f4637afb26cf411dabab6
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:42
#: 235db63c01a9405fa2c0b0466face770
msgid "重训后用 DFT 计算几个螺旋构型的能量作为参考，对比模型预测的 E(q) 曲线"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, compare the predicted `E(q)` curve "
"with DFT energies for held-out spiral configurations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:43
#: 01d8048029e749379950adcff86455d4
msgid "如果极小值位置仍偏离，加密 `period_range` 扫描（例如 `[10, 40, 5]`）"
msgstr ""
"If the position of the minimum remains inaccurate, densify "
"`period_range`, for example to `[10, 40, 5]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:44
#: 7e5f722a6f77445886356bd188b8bbd9
msgid "如果发现 conical spiral（mz != 0）的能量比纯 helix 更低，加入 `mz = [0, 0.5, 0.1]` 覆盖锥面螺旋"
msgstr ""
"If conical spirals with `mz != 0` are lower in energy than the planar "
"helix, add `mz = [0, 0.5, 0.1]` to cover axial components."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:45
#: 0812906966b945339597773121179c12
msgid "如果需要晶格相容的周期，勾选 `Period Filter` 开启整周期约束"
msgstr ""
"Enable `Period Filter` when only periods commensurate with the current "
"cell should be retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:47
#: ee7b1c0c93644017b07ecce75840735f
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:49
#: 33dbce558e5f4d568a5667f1177dfb52
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:50
#: e8217d5266fb4b248d998ecda33c7543
msgid "研究体系存在螺旋/非共线磁基态（如 chiral magnet、skyrmion 宿主材料）"
msgstr ""
"The system has a spiral or noncollinear magnetic state, as in a chiral "
"magnet or skyrmion-host material."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:51
#: 74472798f24c45ccbf8062ec42123fd5
msgid "模型在非共线磁序上泛化失败"
msgstr "The model fails to generalize to noncollinear magnetic order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:52
#: 075bac09c51f4928882e0363bd26ec01
msgid "需要系统覆盖 q 空间的磁激发"
msgstr "You need systematic coverage of magnetic excitations over wave vector `q`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:54
#: 1910003a02c24ab2a24942230fd6c7f6
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:55
#: 9bcc8db8cea342689b14ea31384c8088
msgid "体系只有共线磁序 → `Magnetic Order` 够用"
msgstr "Only collinear order is relevant → `Magnetic Order` is sufficient."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:56
#: c4c0f3ddc23e45769444729e77058ca7
msgid "需要局部小角度偏转而非长程螺旋 → 用 `Small-Angle Spin Tilt`"
msgstr ""
"You need local small-angle canting rather than a long-range spiral → use "
"`Small-Angle Spin Tilt`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:57
#: bd21d3637b8e407796d8f2679ff4bffd
msgid "晶体结构本身需要扩胞才能容纳目标周期 → 先扩胞再回来"
msgstr ""
"The target period does not fit the current cell → build a suitable "
"supercell first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:59
#: 0fa4620d626e448ca627d5428043b642
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:61
#: ba32b03d536e4bb6952293638d3116bb
msgid "螺旋轴和周期"
msgstr "Propagation axis and period"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:63
#: 22ce7c3723cf4ee791d19d4cb587745f
msgid "Axis（axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:65
#: 3629ccab87214b409e10ceea6e7624c0
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)`。螺旋相位沿此方向传播，原子坐标在该方向的投影用于计算相位，格式 `[x, y, z]`。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Direction along which the phase propagates. Each atom's projected "
"coordinate on this axis determines its phase. Format: `[x, y, z]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:67
#: f20b4221a6a94cad83386d88e6fdb41a
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:69
#: 818fec2cbdc8475db167fb5b2a110f96
msgid "Spiral Parameter Mode（spiral_parameter_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:71
#: ef071daecdae4ded89b70cf7fb9a6f5b
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Period (L_D)'`。`Period (L_D)` 适合已知螺旋周期或要扫 E(q) 曲线；`Angle "
"gradient (deg/A)` 适合直接控制每埃旋转角。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Period (L_D)'`. Use `Period (L_D)` when scanning known "
"spiral periods or an `E(q)` curve. Use `Angle gradient (deg/A)` to "
"control rotation directly in degrees per Å."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:73
#: 12cdb545930144a58ee0a1219ac70ab7
msgid "Period Range（period_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:75
#: 675001fd0341401d8f8bde6e8ae43a3c
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(20.0, 40.0, 10.0)`。`[min,"
" max, step]` 格式，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(20.0, 40.0, "
"10.0)`. Period range in Å, expressed as `[minimum, maximum, step]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:76
#: 62f2a102e72442e0a8b85b7c1237df4e
msgid "保守：`[20, 20, 5]`（单周期）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[20, 20, 5]` (one period)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:77
#: 11bcabcd00fe42a7a6bea6b3b31997c4
msgid "平衡：`[10, 40, 10]`（4 个周期）"
msgstr "Balanced: `[10, 40, 10]` (four periods)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:78
#: 5b74ebaf22aa4f2fa476454540f2b712
msgid "探索：`[4, 80, 4]`（宽范围）"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[4, 80, 4]` (broad range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:80
#: 21b6bf4bb2814ba4b52e165910e7010c
msgid "Angle Gradient Range（angle_gradient_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:82
#: 04915aa068b6464e9e04384716d43b3d
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(18.0, 18.0, 1.0)`。`[min, "
"max, step]` 格式，单位 deg/A。值越大旋转越快——360/L_D = 梯度。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(18.0, 18.0, 1.0)`."
" Rotation-gradient range in degrees per Å, expressed as `[minimum, "
"maximum, step]`. The gradient is `360 / L_D`, so larger values correspond"
" to shorter periods."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:84
#: b945a0b419cc4480904b14984ce798ee
msgid "Layer Tolerance（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:86
#: ad2a63a0424544d1afebe8784ebb0c52
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05`。投影差小于此阈值的原子归为同一层。仅在 `Layer-locked` 模式下生效。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Atoms whose projected coordinates differ by "
"less than this tolerance are assigned to the same layer. Used only in "
"`Layer-locked` mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:88
#: 47a32212fed3462caec320aa254bd2c5
msgid "Only Commensurate Periods（only_commensurate_periods）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:90
#: 43007f3b24284564b82a1f658dc69f1d
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 "
"`False`。勾选后只保留与当前晶格周期边界相容的周期，程序在指定区间内自动搜索相容周期。如果没有相容周期，卡片会给出建议的超胞倍数。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `False`. Retain only periods commensurate with the "
"current periodic cell. The card searches the requested range and, if none"
" fit, reports a suggested supercell multiplier."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:92
#: 57980423b29341d4b72d39031b3eb6d2
msgid "相位和形状"
msgstr "Phase and spiral shape"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:94
#: 5cdf11a1b65348fc93d1e47202d238ae
msgid "Phase Range（phase_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:96
#: b0082792ca9949a5a6d3968fd9cbc75d
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 15.0)`。`[min, "
"max, step]`，全局相位偏移，单位度。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 15.0)`. "
"Global phase offsets as `[min, max, step]` in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:97
#: 0af3965c9ad94005bf9bfbe46b60878c
msgid "保守：`[0, 0, 15]`（单个相位）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[0, 0, 15]` (one phase)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:98
#: ac4eb9948bfe4c019eedaa41d83338d3
msgid "平衡：`[0, 90, 30]`（4 个相位）"
msgstr "Balanced: `[0, 90, 30]` (four phases)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:99
#: db23094dedee482692d159d13a8688ad
msgid "探索：`[-180, 180, 30]`（全相位空间）"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[-180, 180, 30]` (full phase range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:101
#: 8a4cd94f880a4daa88e35ccb40e4374d
msgid "Mz（mz）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:103
#: ea4649817c2042f59284feb378d6c11d
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, "
"0.1)`。沿传播轴的单位化分量，范围 [-1, 1]。0 = 纯 helix，非零 = conical spiral。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 0.1)`. "
"Normalized component along the propagation axis, in `[-1, 1]`. Zero gives"
" a planar helix; a nonzero value gives a conical spiral."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:104
#: e4724922696c4a098d6998c19787680f
msgid "保守：`[0, 0, 0.1]`（纯 helix）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[0, 0, 0.1]` (planar helix)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:105
#: 3fefd9a221a74be1b25bed65680ebf5c
msgid "平衡：`[0, 0.5, 0.1]`（弱 conical）"
msgstr "Balanced: `[0, 0.5, 0.1]` (moderate conical component)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:106
#: 747bfbe302144da58e02e27ace8fc76a
msgid "探索：`[-0.9, 0.9, 0.1]`（全 conical 空间）"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[-0.9, 0.9, 0.1]` (broad conical range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:108
#: 12edd71dab1a484eaf71fe4b877680ed
msgid "Chirality（chirality）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:110
#: 30afa0278e7445528552c0471a87a39f
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Both'`。`Clockwise` / `Counterclockwise` / `Both`。选 `Both` "
"会对同一组参数生成一对手性相反的构型。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Both'`. Choose `Clockwise`, `Counterclockwise`, or "
"`Both`. `Both` generates a pair of opposite chiralities for every other "
"parameter combination."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:112
#: 8094e365dcd943458cfa508643530c19
msgid "Phase Mode（phase_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:114
#: da79936f4f1342e4881061a83b813dc0
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Continuous by position'`。`Continuous by "
"position`：每个原子按自身投影坐标独立计算相位，适合标准连续螺旋。`Layer-"
"locked`：先按投影坐标分层，同层原子共享相位，适合层状体系。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Continuous by position'`. In `Continuous by position`, "
"each atom's phase follows its own projected coordinate. In `Layer-"
"locked`, projected positions are clustered into layers and all atoms in "
"one layer share a phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:116
#: 126ec3b6fb8443ee8069e4fb74dec527
msgid "磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Moment magnitudes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:118
#: e5b3497f87074d11bc8cc3b70cb89679
msgid "Magnitude Source（magnitude_source）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:120
#: a8809eb36c0b46139f1ba8ba6c10c0ad
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。可选 `Existing initial magmoms` "
"复用已有磁矩，或 `Map/default magnitude` 用元素映射生成幅值。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'Existing initial magmoms'`. Choose `Existing initial "
"magmoms` to reuse stored moments or `Map/default magnitude` to create "
"magnitudes from an element map."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:122
#: 57294f7dae82440b9deaa9977b7b1632
msgid "**`Magmom Map`** / **`Default Moment`**：仅在 `Map/default magnitude` 模式下生效。"
msgstr ""
"**`Magmom Map`** / **`Default Moment`**: used only in `Map/default "
"magnitude` mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:124
#: af77f8c621f84764899cb71c7081a366
msgid "Magmom Map（magmom_map）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:126
#: 7154568468c844758bf03ff825f43a7c
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。已知元素局域磁矩时显式写入，如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。未知元素不要用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. Provide known element-resolved local moments "
"explicitly, for example `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`. Do not invent a prior for an "
"unknown element through a default value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:128
#: d6d767563c9f440098341680513a060c
msgid "Default Moment（default_moment）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:130
#: c7ca6016bbb84d938b621885dc05eb23
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `magmom_map` 未命中元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`. Used only when an element is absent from "
"`magmom_map`. List important magnetic elements explicitly; nonmagnetic "
"elements should normally remain at 0."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:132
#: aacc6d40e37f499c93f94197bcd8c8d0
msgid "Apply Elements（apply_elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:134
#: 6c0fc9914c684c90a0166b9b6ae7c850
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。限制哪些元素施加螺旋纹理，留空则全部参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Restricts the spiral texture to selected elements. "
"Leave empty to include all elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:136
#: 32f08a29ea1e4c519844420a07acb918
msgid "输出预算"
msgstr "Output budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:138
#: d30f8a5cd7164455bc6fd0d88b29b4ce
msgid "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:140
#: 185b2f97a0bf46b8b8bb4ab00fdc8416
msgid "`int`，默认 `100`。周期、相位、手性和锥角组合会迅速相乘放大输出数量。E(q) 曲线先保留几十个点，全参数探索时再放大上限。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `100`. Periods, phases, chiralities, and axial components"
" form a Cartesian product. Keep an initial `E(q)` scan to a few dozen "
"points, then raise the cap only for a deliberate full-space study."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:142
#: f67f077b2756445c9eb781563692093e
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:144
#: bfc07703063d42fbb7a8115acd124460
msgid "单周期纯 helix 验证（2 个输出，先确认方向正确）"
msgstr ""
"Single-period planar-helix check (2 outputs; verify propagation and "
"chirality)"

