#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:213
#: 9ba6c558456e4aee937ffc3001ea595c
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:215
#: 60b60faf49934ab686f2a8b69038813c
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Spiral`：先确定局域磁矩模长，再扫螺旋周期和 mz"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Spiral`: establish local moment magnitudes, then"
" scan spiral period and `mz`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:216
#: 7258207f9d1346769f5df4d642947873
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Spin Spiral`：先统一写入磁矩幅值，再做螺旋"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Spin Spiral`: standardize moment magnitudes, "
"then impose the spiral."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:217
#: 558f933b4f3d49139bcc318560e5ec11
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Spin Spiral`：扩胞后容纳更长周期，再用整周期约束锁相"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` → `Spin Spiral`: enlarge the cell to accommodate longer "
"periods, then enforce commensurability."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:219
#: 865e2ae857b24473bce5d0b0c1c70609
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:221
#: 896a9716c01143eba63cbf6cd10d6d4a
msgid ""
"**输出为空 / 只有原始输入。** 磁矩幅值全为 0（检查 `magnitude_source` 和 `magmom_map`）。`Period"
" Filter` 开启且区间内没有相容周期——卡片会打印建议超胞倍数。"
msgstr ""
"**No output is produced, or only the original input remains.** All moment"
" magnitudes may be zero; check `magnitude_source` and `magmom_map`. "
"Alternatively, `Period Filter` found no commensurate period in the "
"requested range; use the reported supercell suggestion."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:223
#: 825ffe1f1d0043b5ae42debebd41d912
msgid ""
"**相邻层相位递进不对。** 检查 `Propagation Axis` 是否指向预期的传播方向。`Phase Mode = Layer-"
"locked` 时调整 `layer_tolerance`。"
msgstr ""
"**Phase progression between layers is incorrect.** Check `Propagation "
"Axis`. In `Phase Mode = Layer-locked`, also tune `layer_tolerance` so "
"physical layers are neither split nor merged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:225
#: 9bf2025867ac4d2b8aa972e0b6da1e73
msgid ""
"**输出比预期的多很多。** `period_range` 步长太小，或 `mz` 范围太宽。设 `max_outputs` "
"上限，先小步长试跑再扩大。"
msgstr ""
"**Far more structures are produced than expected.** `period_range` may "
"use a fine step or `mz` may span too many values. Set `max_outputs` and "
"validate a small scan before expanding it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:227
#: 9c02b7408384440a8330b7e2e3f554b2
msgid ""
"**conical spiral 的 mz 值看不懂。** mz 是无量纲比值 m_parallel / |m|，不是以 mu_B "
"计的绝对磁矩。物理上它只能取 [-1, 1]。"
msgstr ""
"**The meaning of conical-spiral `mz` is unclear.** It is the "
"dimensionless ratio `m_parallel / |m|`, not an absolute moment in μB, and"
" must lie in `[-1, 1]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:229
#: 288cfe8d71ee401a81d3994af055dc74
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:231
#: 6b80cbc12fe248019a4a0dee1f43cbc5
msgid "`Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)`：纯平面 helix"
msgstr "`Helix(L=...,ph=...,mz=0,chi=...,ax=...)`: planar helix"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:232
#: 927bc089c15a4473ac6995e4c4e8b4ed
msgid "`Spiral(L=...,ph=...,mz=...,chi=...,ax=...)`：conical spiral"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:233
#: a88c3e1a0eec41cdabef7a890e8728ed
msgid "附加 `pm=layer,ltol=...`：仅 layer-locked 模式"
msgstr "Additional `pm=layer,ltol=...`: present only in layer-locked mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:235
#: d7a240536d794422b4d3deda7f6ecc4c
msgid "所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`；内部同步维护 ASE `initial_magmoms` 三列向量别名。"
msgstr ""
"All exported outputs use `spin:R:3`; an ASE `initial_magmoms` "
"three-component vector alias is kept in sync internally."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:237
#: 241392b4d4e54d458e0ee89db3418a75
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-spiral-card.md:239
#: 7611564eb16b4d83a4bd287087216f91
msgid "无随机性。相同输入结构与相同参数 → 严格一致输出。相位原点固定为传播轴最小投影位置。"
msgstr ""
"Deterministic. The same input structure and parameters produce identical "
"output. The phase origin is fixed at the minimum projection along the "
"propagation axis."
